Registan Travel Website
About the Project

Registan Travel is a responsive travel agency website created as part of CSIT248 – Lab Work 5 at Amity University Tashkent.

The website is designed for a fictional travel agency based in Tashkent, Uzbekistan. It allows visitors to explore available tours and submit booking requests.

Technologies Used
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript
Bootstrap 5
Project Features
1. Home Page
Responsive navigation bar
Hero section with a booking button
Three tour cards
Tour badges and prices
Hover effects and responsive layout
2. Booking Page
Customer name and email fields
Tour selection
Number of travellers (1–12)
Travel date selection
Automatic total price calculation
10% discount for groups of 5 or more
Form validation and booking confirmation
3. Bootstrap Version
Bootstrap 5 navigation bar
Responsive grid system
Bootstrap cards
Same brand colours and tour information
